(3. Artifact Store) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   - Use S3 for artifacts.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   - Store models, plots, evaluation reports, confusion matrices, and other large files.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   - Example artifact root:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(     s3://your-mlflow-bucket/mlflow-artifacts) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(4. IAM) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   - Attach an IAM role to the EC2 instance or container task.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   - Give permission only to the specific S3 bucket/prefix used by MLflow.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   - Avoid broad AmazonS3FullAccess in serious projects.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(5. Network and Security) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   - Do not expose MLflow openly to the internet unless protected.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   - Prefer private subnet access, VPN, or an authenticated reverse proxy.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   - Use security groups to restrict port 5000 or proxy ports to trusted IPs.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   - Add TLS/HTTPS when exposing a UI/API.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
